OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning will be chilly but
OL,6,Ftemperatures will soon rise to feel
OL,7,Fpleasantly mild in sunny spells. Any
OL,8,Fearly morning showers will fade and
OL,9,Fwinds will remain as a light or gentle
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will be cool,
OL,13,Fbut temperatures will rise through the
OL,14,Fnight to feel mild by dawn. Patchy
OL,15,Frain and drizzle will arrive from
OL,16,Faround the middle of the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
