OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FOvercast and murky with patchy
OL,6,Frain and some heavy outbreaks.
OL,7,FBecoming breezy, with some strong
OL,8,Fgusts in the evening, but feeling very
OL,9,Fmild with temperatures reaching the
OL,10,Fhigh-teens.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,13,Fand strong winds will pass on Tuesday
OL,14,Fmorning to become brighter and cooler.
OL,15,FBreezy during Wednesday but dry and
OL,16,Fbright, then increasingly cloudy,
OL,17,Fshowery and windy through Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
